1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Driftline turns a changed operational promise into evidence-bound, reviewable action.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Live Cloud Run workflow: Gemini 3.5 Flash + Google ADK inspect an allowlisted source and pause at the deterministic human gate.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The approval creates a reversible Firestore change packet and a versioned private Cloud Storage artifact.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Undo reopens the workflow and writes a rollback marker. No external customer system is changed.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Public demo: driftline-ops.web.app · github.com/mikeyerke/driftline
